{{Documentation/Header}}
A left-floating 200&nbsp;px card for a notable utattemita: thumbnail, title, producer credits, Niconico and YouTube links, and a collapsible description.

Missing video links are shown as greyed-out placeholder icons rather than being hidden, so the card keeps a consistent shape.

==Syntax==
{{T|NotableUtattemita|block=1
|v1=image =
|v2=title =
|v3=producer =
|v4=NND =
|v5=YT =
|v6=description =
}}

==Example==
{{T|NotableUtattemita|_Y_=1|block=1
|p1=image = Template doc.png
|p2=title = Song Title
|p3=producer = Producer Name
|p4=NND = sm12345
|p5=YT = 12ab34cd
|p6=description = A short description of the song, shown collapsed by default.
}}
{{clear}}

{| class="dataTable sortable"
! Parameter !! Aliases !! Label !! Description !! Type !! Default !! Status
|-
| <code>title</code> || – || Title || The song title, shown on a pale blue band. || string || – || <span style="color:red;font-weight:bold;">Required</span>
|-
| <code>image</code> || – || Image || Thumbnail filename without the <code>File:</code> prefix, displayed at 200×112&nbsp;px. || wiki-file-name || – ||
|-
| <code>producer</code> || – || Producer(s) || Producer credits. Wrap long credit lists in {{T|Scrollbox}}. || string || – ||
|-
| <code>NND</code> || – || Niconico ID || Niconico video ID (e.g. <code>sm12345</code>). Omitted shows a greyed placeholder. || string || – ||
|-
| <code>YT</code> || – || YouTube ID || YouTube video ID. Omitted shows a greyed placeholder. || string || – ||
|-
| <code>description</code> || – || Description || Longer text, rendered in a collapsed box the reader can expand. || string || – ||
|}

